    <node id="黑塔">
      <data key="d0">黑塔</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">黑塔is a person mentioned, appears young despite being famous over a hundred years ago during the previous Amber Era.&lt;SEP&gt;黑塔is a genius who was targeted by银狼.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c62549d358805658f577edf0ab9b10f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a3cfc8f55ca58a8b49ae984321424c78</data>
