      <data key="d0">天才俱乐部</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Genius Society is an organization that黑塔is a member of.&lt;SEP&gt;天才俱乐部is an organization for geniuses, potentially including the white-bearded old man.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c62549d358805658f577edf0ab9b10f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a3cfc8f55ca58a8b49ae984321424c78</data>
