    <node id="博识尊">
      <data key="d0">博识尊</data>
      <data key="d1">aeon</data>
      <data key="d2">博识尊is the Aeon of Erudition, and黑塔is an Emanator of博识尊.&lt;SEP&gt;博识尊is a star god that may have been created by赞达尔.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c62549d358805658f577edf0ab9b10f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a3cfc8f55ca58a8b49ae984321424c78</data>
