      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">艾利欧is a member of the Star Hunters known for foreseeing the future and writing "scripts" for the team's actions.&lt;SEP&gt;艾利欧is a person who took interest in银狼after her actions against螺丝咕姆.</data>
